# Copy this file to "credentials.env" (same directory as run.py) and fill
# in a Cambium account below. credentials.env is gitignored - it never gets
# committed, so this is safe to keep as the checked-in template.
#
# Anyone else using this tool should do the same with their own account -
# or a shared, non-personal account your team sets up specifically for this
# automation - rather than everyone using one person's real login. See the
# README's "Read this first" section: this automates around Cambium's ToS
# and an active anti-bot check, so whoever's account is in here is the one
# taking on that account-risk.

CAMBIUM_EMAIL=
CAMBIUM_PASSWORD=
